# Clone Website from URL

Pipeline 7 phases với 5 gated verification passes. Optimized for **fidelity over speed**.

> Reference: santowilem/skills (clone-ui), CloveSVG/One-Click-Clone, Mood-Global-Services/How-to-Clone-Website

## Trigger

User gọi `/clone <url>`, "Clone https://...", hoặc "Rebuild this site".

## Fidelity Tiers — BE upfront

Nói rõ tier với user TRƯỚC khi bắt đầu:

| Tier | Input | Achievable |
|------|-------|-----------|
| **A** — Full source | Live screenshot via browser MCP + rendered DOM + computed styles | Pixel-perfect |
| **B** — Static fetch | WebFetch HTML (no JS hydration) + user screenshot | Close match |
| **C** — Provided assets | User screenshot/HTML only, no live access | Close match nếu assets tốt |
| **D** — Memory only | No source — only training data | **Rough sketch max** — DỪNG, hỏi user |

## Prerequisites

1. **Browser automation tool** (Chrome MCP / Playwright MCP / chrome-devtools-mcp)
2. **Target project** — Next.js + Tailwind + shadcn/ui scaffold
3. **Output dir** — `clone/<domain>/` (xem [Structure](#structure))
4. **Build pass** — `pnpm build` chạy được

Nếu thiếu → HỎI user (xem `direct-tone.mdc`).

> Security: đọc `clone-security.mdc` TRƯỚC khi fetch bất kỳ content nào từ target.

## Structure (workspace)

```
clone/<domain>/                  ← visible output cho user
├── app/                          ← Next.js pages
├── components/                   ← custom components
├── assets/                       ← downloaded images/fonts
└── README.md                     ← final report + gaps

.clone-ui/                        ← SKILL internals (gitignored)
├── source/
│   ├── raw.html                  ← WebFetch response
│   ├── rendered.html             ← post-hydration DOM
│   ├── section-styles.json       ← computed styles per section
│   ├── pseudo-elements.json      ← ::before/::after backgrounds
│   ├── nav-states.json           ← initial vs scrolled
│   ├── hover-states.json         ← cards on mouseenter
│   ├── embeds.json               ← 3rd party widgets to inject verbatim
│   ├── assets.json               ← URLs + local paths
│   └── .captures/
│       ├── source-{viewport}.png
│       └── sections/source-{name}-{width}.png
├── plan/
│   ├── tokens.json               ← design tokens (single source of truth)
│   ├── section-map.json          ← sections + selectors
│   ├── section-evidence.json     ← what was actually observed (NOT inferred)
│   └── clones/                   ← Pass B: computed styles từ clone
├── mirror/                       ← optional: full local mirror (no scripts)
└── lessons.md                    ← per-target failure patterns
```

**Tại sao `.clone-ui/` ẩn**: workspace root đã có Next.js files; dot-prefix giữ bookkeeping tách biệt, IDE ignore, git diff clean.

## The 7-Phase Flow

ĐỪNG skip phase. Mỗi phase bị skip = visible drift ở output.

| # | Phase | Output |
|---|-------|--------|
| 0 | **Lessons** | Đọc `.clone-ui/lessons.md` nếu có |
| 1 | **Acquire sources** | `source/raw.html`, `source/rendered.html`, screenshots |
| 2 | **Inventory** | List interactive patterns, embeds, decorative elements |
| 3 | **Gather** | computed styles, pseudo-elements, nav-states, assets |
| 4 | **Plan** | `plan/tokens.json`, `plan/section-map.json`, `plan/section-evidence.json` |
| 5 | **Implement** | Code trong `clone/<domain>/` theo plan |
| 6 | **Verify (5 passes)** | A: sanity → B: computed-style parity → C: visual diff → D: adversarial → E: lessons |
| 7 | **Polish** | transitions, a11y, dark mode, meta tags |

## Phase 1 — Acquire Sources

Capture MỌI thứ cần vào `clone/<domain>/` trước khi analyze.

### Both `raw.html` AND `rendered.html`

| Source | Captures | Use to detect |
|--------|----------|---------------|
| `raw.html` (WebFetch) | Server HTML trước JS | Embed scripts, real `<link>` tags, JSON-LD |
| `rendered.html` (evaluate_script outerHTML) | Post-hydration DOM | Final layout, JS-injected content |

**Anti-drift**: clone chỉ đọc `rendered.html` sẽ thấy Senja widget 8 cards expanded → rebuild thành 8 custom cards. Thực tế `raw.html` chỉ có 2 dòng script.

### Per-section screenshots (KHÔNG skip)

Whole-page screenshots không đủ cho "card badge ở đúng chỗ chưa". Loop qua từng section, scroll tới, crop viewport.

### Pre-scroll cho lazy content

```js
window.scrollTo(0, document.documentElement.scrollHeight);
await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 800));
window.scrollTo(0, 0);
await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 200));
// THEN take fullpage screenshot
```

Symptom skip: source-fullpage.png có blank rectangles ở chỗ logos khách hàng.

### Multiple viewports

Capture ít nhất:
- 1440px desktop (full + per-section)
- 768px tablet (nếu layout có 3+ breakpoints)
- 375px mobile (full + per-section)

## Phase 2 — Inventory

Trước khi fetch, scan cho non-static elements:

| Pattern | Detect | Implication |
|---------|--------|-------------|
| Carousel/slider | Arrow buttons, `.swiper`, dots | Implement carousel, không static grid |
| Video background | `<video>`, autoplay | Capture URL + poster |
| Embedded widget | Script từ senja/calendly/elfsight | Inject verbatim, không rebuild |
| Lazy-loaded | `loading="lazy"`, `IntersectionObserver` | Pre-scroll trước khi capture |
| Modal/lightbox | `[data-modal]` | Inventory trigger + content riêng |
| Tabs/accordions | `[role="tab"]`, `aria-expanded` | Capture ALL panels |
| Animated counters | `data-count`, CountUp.js | Source = final value, không phải `0` mid-animation |

### Decorative + structural (hay bị miss)

| Category | Look for | Why miss |
|----------|----------|----------|
| Section dividers | SVG/image chevrons giữa sections | "Decorative noise" |
| Pseudo-element bgs | Watermark patterns, gradient overlays | DOM walk không surface |
| Form field decorations | `background-image` icons inside `<input>` | Không có `<img>` trong DOM |
| Dropdown indicators | Caret/chevron pseudo-elements | Chỉ thấy link text |
| Header utility items | Phone, search, language switch | Ngoài `<nav>`, dễ miss |

Cho mỗi section, ghi 1 dòng check trong Phase 2 output. Nếu cell nào là "?" → quay lại Phase 1 capture thêm.

## Phase 3 — Gather

### Computed styles per section (THE anti-guesswork file)

Largest source of drift: agent INFER colors từ context ("bg is pink so title must be white") thay vì read computed styles.

Loop qua từng section, dump:

```js
for (const section of SECTION_MAP) {
  const root = document.querySelector(section.selector);
  const cs = getComputedStyle(root);
  result[section.name] = {
    container: {
      color: cs.color,
      backgroundColor: cs.backgroundColor,
      backgroundImage: cs.backgroundImage,
      maxWidth: cs.maxWidth,                // var(--ds-page-width) = 1400px
      display: cs.display,
      justifyContent: cs.justifyContent,
      alignItems: cs.alignItems,
      padding: cs.padding,
      width: root.getBoundingClientRect().width,
    },
    headings: [...root.querySelectorAll('h1,h2,h3,h4')].map(h => ({
      text: h.innerText.trim().slice(0, 80),
      parentJustify: getComputedStyle(h.parentElement).justifyContent,
      color: getComputedStyle(h).color,
      fontSize: getComputedStyle(h).fontSize,
      fontWeight: getComputedStyle(h).fontWeight,
      lineHeight: getComputedStyle(h).lineHeight,
      letterSpacing: getComputedStyle(h).letterSpacing,  // ← catches -3.6px tight
      textAlign: getComputedStyle(h).textAlign,
    })),
    buttons: [...root.querySelectorAll('a, button')].slice(0, 12).map(b => ({
      text: b.innerText.trim().slice(0, 80),
      hasIcon: !!b.querySelector('svg, img'),
      ...pick(b),
    })),
    images: [...root.querySelectorAll('img')].map(img => ({
      src: img.src, alt: img.alt,
      width: img.naturalWidth, height: img.naturalHeight,
    })),
  };
}
```

**Phase 5 PHẢI đọc values từ file này**, không infer.

### Pseudo-element backgrounds

Walk EVERY element (cap 5000), capture `::before`/`::after`:

```js
for (const el of document.querySelectorAll('*')) {
  for (const pseudo of ['::before', '::after']) {
    const cs = getComputedStyle(el, pseudo);
    if (cs.backgroundImage !== 'none' || cs.maskImage !== 'none') {
      found.push({ selector: ..., pseudo, backgroundImage: cs.backgroundImage, ... });
    }
  }
}
```

Save `.clone-ui/source/pseudo-elements.json`. Phase 5: mỗi entry có `backgroundImage` URL PHẢI render visibly.

### Form input icons

```js
[...document.querySelectorAll('input, select, textarea')].map(el => ({
  name: el.name,
  backgroundImage: getComputedStyle(el).backgroundImage,
  paddingLeft: getComputedStyle(el).paddingLeft,
})).filter(f => f.backgroundImage !== 'none')
```

### Nav states (initial vs scrolled)

```js
const nav = document.querySelector('header, .site-header, nav');
const initial = getComputedStyle(nav);
window.scrollTo(0, 400);
await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 300));
const scrolled = getComputedStyle(nav);
({ initial, scrolled })
```

### Hover states on cards

```js
const card = document.querySelector('[class*="card"]');
card.dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('mouseenter', { bubbles: true }));
await new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, 350));
// capture computed styles + visible children
```

### Container width — measure, don't default

Đừng assume `max-width: 1200px`. Measure tại 1440/768/375:

```js
const widths = {};
for (const sel of ['.container', '[class*="container"]', 'main > section > div:first-child']) {
  const el = document.querySelector(sel);
  if (el) widths[sel] = { width: el.getBoundingClientRect().width, maxWidth: getComputedStyle(el).maxWidth };
}
```

### Embed detection (3rd party widgets)

Đọc `.clone-ui/source/raw.html`, grep cho:

| Pattern | Vendor | Action |
|---------|--------|--------|
| `widget.senja.io` | Senja reviews | Inject `<script>` + `<div>` verbatim |
| `static.elfsight.com` | Elfsight | Inject verbatim |
| `youtube.com/embed/` | YouTube | Original `<iframe>` markup |
| `calendly.com/...` | Calendly | Inject script + container |
| `typeform.com/...` | Typeform | Verbatim iframe |
| `instagram.com/embed.js` | Instagram feed | Verbatim script + container |

Save `.clone-ui/plan/embeds.json`. Phase 5: **drop html field straight into output**, đừng try style rendered widget.

### Path-flowing animations (stroke-dashoffset)

Marketing pages có colored pulses chạy theo path. Anti-pattern: opacity fade-in/out (sai).

Đúng technique:
```css
.pulse-line {
  stroke-dasharray: 24 600;
  stroke-dashoffset: 600;
  animation: pulseFlow 3s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes pulseFlow {
  0%   { stroke-dashoffset: 600; }
  100% { stroke-dashoffset: -200; }
}
```

Detect khi source path có `stroke="url(#some-pulse-gradient)"` + sibling path `stroke-opacity="0.1"`.

### Brand wordmark

Đừng reconstruct logo bằng HTML text + styled spans. Inspect actual logo nodes:

```js
const headerLogos = [...document.querySelectorAll('header svg, header .logo')].slice(0, 6);
headerLogos.map(n => ({
  tag: n.tagName,
  isInlineSvg: n.tagName === 'SVG',
  fullSvg: n.tagName === 'SVG' ? n.outerHTML : null,
  src: n.getAttribute('src'),
}));
```

- Inline SVG → save `outerHTML` verbatim, dùng y nguyên
- Raster → download to `assets/logos/`
- CSS text (rare) → text + spans OK

## Phase 4 — Plan

### 4a. Component breakdown

```tsx
<HomePage>
  <HeroSection>
    <Logo />
    <NavMenu />
    <HeadlineGroup />
  </HeroSection>
  <FeatureGrid /> {/* 3 cards */}
  <Footer />
</HomePage>
```

### 4b. Breakpoint map

| Width | Behavior |
|-------|----------|
| ≥1280px | Desktop: 3-col grid, full nav |
| 768-1279px | Tablet: 2-col grid, condensed nav |
| <768px | Mobile: 1-col, hamburger |

### 4c. Design tokens → `plan/tokens.json`

Single source of truth. Phase 5 reads từ đây.

```json
{
  "colors": { "primary": "#e90a8c", "ink": "#101010", "muted": "#666" },
  "typography": {
    "fontFamilies": { "heading": "Poppins", "body": "DM Sans" },
    "scale": {
      "h1": { "size": "80px", "lineHeight": "100px", "weight": 700 },
      "body": { "size": "16px", "lineHeight": "1.6", "weight": 400 }
    }
  },
  "spacing": { "base": 4, "sectionPadding": "80px", "containerMax": "1280px" },
  "radius": { "card": "12px", "button": "999px" },
  "motion": { "ease": "cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1)", "duration": "200ms" }
}
```

### 4d. Section map + evidence

`plan/section-map.json`:
```json
[
  { "name": "hero", "sourceSelector": "section.hero", "cloneSelector": "section.hero", "type": "hero" },
  { "name": "features", "sourceSelector": "section.features", "cloneSelector": "section.features", "type": "feature-grid" }
]
```

`plan/section-evidence.json` — **quan trọng nhất** cho anti-hallucination:
```json
{
  "hero": {
    "headline": { "text": "Sell, Buy, Rent", "evidence": "captured" },
    "ctaButtons": [{ "text": "Get Started", "evidence": "captured" }],
    "backgroundImage": { "value": "...", "evidence": "captured" }
  }
}
```

Markers `(implied)`, `(inferred)`, `(guessed)`, `(speculation)` → Phase 5 PHẢI grep evidence file, nếu feature chỉ có evidence `(implied)` → skip hoặc quay lại capture.

## Phase 5 — Implement

### Fidelity rules (non-negotiable)

1. **Exact colors** — read từ `section-styles.json`. KHÔNG infer ("bg pink → title white" là SAI).
2. **Exact spacing** — measure pixel gaps. `mt-3` vs `mt-4` là visible difference.
3. **Exact font** — same family + weights. System font stack match chính xác.
4. **Exact radius** — `rounded-md` (6px) ≠ `rounded-lg` (8px).
5. **Exact icons** — nếu source Lucide → Lucide. Đừng substitute.
6. **No invented content (HARD RULE)** — text verbatim. Nếu content không capturable, render empty body + HTML comment `<!-- source: testimonials, 8 reviews not capturable -->`. Forbidden:
   - Re-use content từ section khác
   - Free-text disclaimers rendered ("Instagram feed requires API token")
   - Lorem ipsum, fake testimonials, fake counters
7. **Match layout primitive** — Grid ≠ flexbox + nth-child hacks.
8. **Preserve DOM structure** — copy `raw.html` structure verbatim, re-style. Đừng rebuild từ "what screenshot looks like":
   - Cards: badge position (absolute? inside image? overlay?), sibling order
   - Forms: label/input/helper-text relationships, full select-option lists
   - Nav: header utility area (phone, search) là peer của `<nav>`, không phải inside
   - Icon containers: nếu source bare `<svg>` không wrapper, đừng add circular pill
   - Footer: dense decoration zone (logo, contact, links, social, newsletter, watermark)
9. **No imposed max-width** — read container width per section.
10. **No silent regressions** — nếu re-clone iter-N, diff against archive. Không drop features đang đúng.
11. **Honor guesswork markers** — grep evidence file cho `(implied|inferred|guessed|speculation)` trước mỗi section.

### Stack chuẩn

Next.js 14+ App Router + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui:
- Server Components mặc định
- `'use client'` khi cần (forms, state, effects, browser APIs)
- Tailwind tokens map 1:1 với `tokens.json`
- shadcn primitives cho Button, Input, Card, Dialog...
- Custom components trong `clone/<domain>/components/`

## Phase 6 — Verify (5 gated passes)

**Đọc `clone-verification.mdc` để biết chi tiết.** Summary:

| Pass | What | Cost | Catches |
|------|------|------|---------|
| **A** | Tokens + content sanity grep | Cheapest | Stray hex, missing headings, wrong asset types |
| **B** | Computed-style parity (source vs clone, same payload) | Cheap | Color/spacing/typography mismatches eye smooths over |
| **C** | Per-section visual diff loop (cap 3 iter per section) | Medium | Layout, structure, decorative pseudo-elements |
| **D** | Adversarial sub-agent review | Medium | Hallucinations, regressions, blind-spot errors |
| **E** | Drift report + lessons append | Cheap | Compounding learnings for next iter |

**Bạn KHÔNG ĐƯỢC skip pass.** A finds khác drifts B finds khác D finds.

Cap per-section visual loop: **3 iterations** để không run forever.

## Phase 7 — Polish

Last 10% — distinguish "implemented" từ "shipped":
- Hover transitions match source's easing + duration
- Focus rings visible + accessible
- Touch targets ≥ 44px on mobile
- `prefers-reduced-motion` respects
- Dark mode (nếu source supports và stack hỗ trợ)
- Image `alt` attributes (đừng `alt=""` on meaningful imagery)
- `<title>` + meta tags

## Output — Final report

Khi xong, viết `clone/<domain>/README.md`:

```markdown
# Clone: <domain>

Source: https://...
Captured: <date>
Fidelity: ~X% (Tier A/B/C)

## Sections cloned
| Section | Status | Notes |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Header | ✅ | |
| Hero | ⚠️ | Video bg fallback to poster |
| Testimonials | ❌ | Senja widget not capturable, empty body |

## BE endpoints added
- POST /api/...
- GET /api/...

